Architecture Diagram

This is a placeholder for the system architecture diagram.

Replace this file with an actual architecture diagram image (PNG format, recommended size: 1200x800px).

The diagram should show:
- System components and their relationships
- Data flow between components
- External dependencies
- Observability layer integration

Recommended tools for creating the diagram:
- Mermaid
- PlantUML
- draw.io
- Excalidraw
